			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 761830101,
					"content": "感謝妳的邀請，桑多涅。茶點也依舊是熟悉的味道，令人懷念。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830102,
					"content": "別客氣。喜歡的話，在至冬我們也像以前一樣多聚聚。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830103,
					"content": "那是自然。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830104,
					"content": "說到至冬，妳那邊一切都還順利嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830105,
					"content": "嗯，女皇陛下的謀劃有了初步進展，但「嚴冬計畫」的執行比市長大人想像中要困難得多。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830106,
					"content": "這麼說妳我之後都要忙起來了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830107,
					"content": "但偶爾出來喝杯茶，或是去科洛列夫茨基劇團看場表演的時間或許還是有的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830124,
					"content": "嗯，偶爾出來喝杯茶，或是去科洛列夫茨基劇團看場表演的時間或許還是有的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830108,
					"content": "奧黛塔還在跳芭蕾嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830109,
					"content": "嗯，一段時間不見，她的技術就又有精進了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830110,
					"content": "真好啊，等回去了我也想去看一場。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830111,
					"content": "有時候看她會覺得很奇妙。明明是羅莎琳教出來的，但性格作風卻和羅莎琳完全不一樣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830112,
					"content": "這也不一定就是壞事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830113,
					"content": "嗯…如果說羅莎琳讓人感覺像熱烈的火，那奧黛塔就像堅實的冰——看不透的那種冰。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830114,
					"content": "她似乎背負了很多東西。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830115,
					"content": "是啊，但她在臺上表演時，舞步又是如此純淨，彷彿心中沒有一絲雜質。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830116,
					"content": "或是將它們封到了人們看不見的地方。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830117,
					"content": "嗯。說到底還是像冰，但一點也不脆弱。堅實的冰——硬要說還是很危險那種。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830118,
					"content": "這點又和羅莎琳很像。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830119,
					"content": "危險的方面？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830120,
					"content": "堅定的方面。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830121,
					"content": "也對，難怪說她是目前最有希望繼承「女士」這一頭銜的愚人眾。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830122,
					"content": "哈…若是未來和她關係再近一些，就邀請她來參加我們的茶會吧。希望她不會拒絕。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 761830123,
					"content": "但願如此吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						761830124
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「僕人」"
				}
			]
		},
